@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml

actor "Visitante" as Guest
boundary "Frontend" as UI

box "Backend" #f9f9f9
    control "auth_controller" as Ctrl <<control>>
    control "auth_service" as Serv <<service>>
    collections "user_repository" as Repo <<repository>>
end box

box "Infra" #e8f4f8
    database "PostgreSQL (DB)" as DB
end box

== Fluxo: Cadastrar Usuário ==

Guest -> UI++: Preenche dados (data)
UI -> Ctrl++: POST /auth/register (data)
Ctrl -> Ctrl++--: Valida entrada (RegisterSchema)

alt Dados inválidos ou incompletos
    note right of Ctrl #f8d7da: **raise** ValidationError
end

Ctrl -> Serv++: register(data)
Serv -> Serv++--: _check_email_availability(email)
Serv -> Repo++: get_user(email)
Repo -> DB++: Obtém User (email)
DB --> Repo--: User / Null
Repo --> Serv--: User / Null

alt Email indisponível
    note right of Serv #f8d7da: **raise** ConflictError
end

Serv -> Serv++--: generate_password_hash(password)
Serv -> Repo++: create(user_data)
Repo -> DB++: Cria User (user_data)
DB --> Repo--: User
Repo --> Serv--: User
Serv -> Serv++--: generate_token(user)
Serv --> Ctrl--: token, User
Ctrl -> Ctrl++--: Aplica AuthResponseSchema (token, User)
Ctrl --> UI--: AuthResponse
note right of UI #d4edda: **Status:** 201 Created
UI --> Guest--: Conta criada e login realizado
@enduml